{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0523_1000_025roc", "source_sha256": "8e193d752df7bc76e1a2fb43aca6bc7ed40963646271e0ce15c25d5d70eda110", "ja": "{$P$}！　突然ですがクエスチョン\nです！　『ロコナイズ』の意味、わかりますか？", "zh": "{$P$}！　虽然很突然，但来提问\n了！　您知道“ROCO化”是什么意思吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0523_1001_p", "source_sha256": "9e3e36e238e83227f6451718238113ee0235bf99cbfb5a375b96f05f1ae44586", "ja": "おお……本当に唐突だな。でも、答えは簡単。\n『ロコ風にする』『ロコの色に染める』という意味だ！", "zh": "哦……确实很突然。不过答案很简单。\n意思就是“变成ROCO风格”“染上ROCO的色彩”！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0523_1002_025roc", "source_sha256": "345862a26623a7d1f83ae10315157366512077b7bc24b8114c07c2d69ea4533a", "ja": "おおお、ザッツライトです！　少しイージーでしたか。\nでは、次はもう少しディフィカルトに……。", "zh": "哦哦哦，答对啦！是不是稍微简单了点。\n那么，接下来要再难一点……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0523_1003_025roc", "source_sha256": "27f82597e1b884dacc095c802f7e3b9ac191bcbfc14ba8a541c43aff5b446f54", "ja": "『ロコアートは、オーディエンスがメモラブルする、\nアメイジングなアートです！』……どうですか？", "zh": "“ROCO艺术，是能让所有观众铭记于心的惊艳艺术！”……怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0523_1004_p", "source_sha256": "dd841a905f7cb67ae7f15128d360f826564c8d46a1281941a027c12da1b61705", "ja": "うーん……『ロコアートは、見る人みんなの心に残る\n素晴らしいアートです』で、合ってるかな？", "zh": "嗯……“ROCO艺术，是能留在所有观赏者心中的精彩艺术”，这样说对吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0523_1005_025roc", "source_sha256": "9a0b61e67721a4505be3b0e931f55b29f1a2b32e703945f8f6982a47970b5eea", "ja": "おおおお！　さすが{$P$}！\n見事、全問正解！　パーフェクトです♪", "zh": "哦哦哦哦！不愧是{$P$}！\n漂亮地全部答对了！满分♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0523_1006_p", "source_sha256": "28a3f5f11e789d3b4460f85d01d65bd2c8d43c14eaacf5b5eb4edccd06b9d47b", "ja": "ふぅ、よかった……。\nけど、急にクイズなんてどうしたんだ？", "zh": "呼，太好了……  \n不过，怎么突然问起竞猜来了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0523_1007_025roc", "source_sha256": "08b59d48cefabc61439f81284d4d959f73856307110a1976557bcbea3ca6b511", "ja": "えへへ……実は今度のクイズショーへ向けて、\nプリパレーションしてたんですけど……。", "zh": "嘿嘿……其实我是在为下次的猜谜节目做准备，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0523_1008_025roc", "source_sha256": "5a98058727f47cfd321555196adb9702caa12f2cfbc6a8ccf087eab72037f5e7", "ja": "スタディの途中で、{$P$}は\nどこまでロコ語がわかるのかなって、思ったんです。", "zh": "学习到一半时，我就在想，{$P$}先生到底能听懂多少ROCO语呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0523_1009_p", "source_sha256": "d3af1e4442a4fc46d70f83d90cf1d202df9402f118973121ac7f955bddfcc72a", "ja": "なるほど、そういうことか……。", "zh": "原来是这样啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0523_1010_025roc", "source_sha256": "05bbc0fdaa5ce84f8adff0b90c0cb32a0901a747bd46b0988324e13a61e2aa47", "ja": "あ、疑ってたわけじゃないですよ！？　ただロコ語は\n少しディフィカルトですから、念のため……。", "zh": "啊，我不是在怀疑你哦！？只是因为ROCO语有点难，为了保险起见……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0523_1011_p", "source_sha256": "baacced87660847eaa7f4f9970dd549aa8e0003bb808414db5ecfda450e4c644", "ja": "確かに。難しい時もあるからな……。\n完璧にわかる、というわけではないかも……。", "zh": "确实。有时候确实挺难懂的……\n也不能说完全都能理解……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0523_1012_025roc", "source_sha256": "5f74b6a8af6a331a1a4b2bb3610c34370cc4fa369e92a5bd00395ca0b7e92728", "ja": "ええっ！？　そ、そうなんですか！？", "zh": "诶！？原、原来是这样吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0523_1013_p", "source_sha256": "a20e51e8f369a2fb5aa413c9d09f21780e2eac7bef0662cc1eb15ee41d13c840", "ja": "うん。だから今後、わからない言葉があったら……\nロコに聞くことにするよ。", "zh": "嗯。所以以后要是遇到不明白的词……我就去问ROCO。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0523_1014_p", "source_sha256": "a8606c608669b69387a69782cab95511f89a9220a95d84e7afd0134f6a365c27", "ja": "ロコのことを、もっと理解したいからね。\nわからないままになんてしないよ。", "zh": "因为我想更深入地了解ROCO。\n不会就这样一直不明白下去的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0523_1015_025roc", "source_sha256": "fff29c22ba980362e574711347b55a159a34945594c1a95cffcaabdca46edef7", "ja": "{$P$}……。はい、オフコースです！\nえへへ、そう言ってもらえるとハッピーです♪", "zh": "{$P$}……嗯，当然啦！\n嘿嘿，你能这么说，我很开心♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0523_1016_025roc", "source_sha256": "cfc8c11e91c963e9c14b3cd58d3363143b732f0057d03300da03b21811b6eb01", "ja": "そうだ！　なら今度、ロコ語をまとめたボキャブラリー\nカードを作りますね！　それでぜひ覚えてください♪", "zh": "对了！那下次我来制作一套汇总了ROCO语的词汇卡片吧！请一定用它来记住哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
